---
layout: base.njk
title: Seb (the Canadian)
description: "Personal site for Seb Lathangue — civic technology, knowledge architecture, and the digital garden."
---
<div class="h-card">
  <p class="identity">
    <span class="masthead__stamp" aria-hidden="true">S&middot;L</span>
    <strong class="p-name">Seb Lathangue</strong>
    <span class="identity__sep">—</span>
    <span class="p-category">civic tech</span>
    <span class="identity__sep">·</span>
    <span class="p-category">knowledge architecture</span>
    <span class="identity__sep">·</span>
    <span class="p-locality">Toronto</span><span class="identity__sep">/</span><span class="p-region">ON</span>
    <a class="u-url u-uid sr-only" href="{{ site.url }}">{{ site.url }}</a>
    <span class="p-country-name sr-only">Canada</span>
  </p>

  <p class="home-lede p-note">I work on knowledge architecture and data governance &mdash; the structures that make information findable, legible, and trustworthy inside organizations &mdash; and run a civic-technology program, <a href="https://civcitdev.ca">CivCitDev</a>, on the side. I treat governance less as rulemaking and more as a design problem: if the governed path is easier than the ungoverned one, people take it without being told to.</p>

  <hr class="pixel-divider" />

  <section id="now" class="home-block home-now panel--alt" aria-label="Now">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Now</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Currently:</strong> {{ now.currently | safe }}
    </p>
    <p class="post-meta">
      <span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><time class="dt-updated" datetime="{{ now.updated }}">{{ now.updated | tendedState }}</time>
    </p>
  </section>

  {%- if gardenPosts.length > 0 %}
  {#- The garden as its own standalone block — the night panel carries its
      own weather (design-v3 Phase 2) and self-labels via the portal. -#}
  <section class="home-block" aria-label="From the garden">
    <div class="index-table garden-panel panel--night">
      <p class="garden-portal">
        <span class="eyebrow">the garden</span>
        <a class="garden-portal__link" href="https://cognitivearchitecture.ca/" rel="external">cognitivearchitecture.ca &#8599;</a>
      </p>
      <p class="garden-portal__note">The main body of my writing lives here &mdash; a digital garden, tended in the open and gathered back to this site.</p>
      {%- for gp in gardenPosts %}{% if loop.index <= 4 %}
      <article class="index-row h-entry">
        <span class="index-row__label">garden/</span>
        <span class="index-row__desc">
          <a class="u-url p-name" href="{{ gp.url }}">{{ gp.title }}</a>
          {%- if gp.status %} <span class="index-pill">{{ gp.status }}</span>{%- endif %}
        </span>
        <time class="index-row__meta dt-published" datetime="{{ gp.date }}">{{ gp.date | humanDate }}</time>
      </article>
      {% endif %}{%- endfor %}
      <div class="index-row">
        <span class="index-row__label">garden/</span>
        <span class="index-row__desc">
          <a href="https://cognitivearchitecture.ca/" rel="external">more in the garden &rarr;</a>
        </span>
        <span class="index-row__meta">{{ "https://cognitivearchitecture.ca/" | hostname }} &#8599;</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  <section class="home-block" aria-label="Projects">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Projects</h2>
    <div class="index-table">
      {%- for project in projects %}
        {%- if project.status == "active" and project.name != "Cognitive Architecture" and "cognitivearchitecture.ca" not in project.url %}
      <div class="index-row">
        <span class="index-row__label">project/</span>
        <span class="index-row__desc">
          <a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.name }}</a>
          <span class="index-pill index-pill--active">active</span>
        </span>
        <span class="index-row__meta">{{ project.url | hostname }} &#8599;</span>
      </div>
        {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-block" aria-label="Elsewhere">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</h2>
    <div class="index-table">
      <div class="index-row">
        <span class="index-row__label">contact/</span>
        <span class="index-row__desc">
          <a class="u-email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
          {%- for profile in profiles %} &middot; <a rel="me" href="{{ profile.url }}">{{ profile.platform | lower }}</a>{%- endfor %}
        </span>
        <span class="index-row__meta"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
